  "interpretation": [
    "Full program and State A current image metadata were updated without mass erase; frozen Boot content, recovery page, State B and per-car Config V5 were retained during firmware refresh.",
    "State A NORMAL sequence 107 initially kept the real old UFS stable version 0.2.58; running 0.2.60 subsequently seeded and confirmed itself.",
    "Ordinary firmware 0.2.60 has no remote first-PSK migration command or get_info PSK fields. PSK credentials were delivered through the token-checked enrollment service under validated SSH operator approval, then injected locally through SWD.",
