    "TIME platform log is emitted only after TimeBase_Synchronize succeeds; it preceded the audited power_on request.",
    "Power success evidence combines the output response, independent MCU readback and powered device heartbeats. Relay/contact feedback and actual vehicle movement were not inspected.",
    "Debugger-induced Boot HAL_Delay halt was cleared using identity-checked raw force attach, clean SYSRESETREQ and removal of FPB/DEMCR/watchdog freeze; no manual Boot-to-App jump was used."
